:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a>:</b> <b>Mithral</b> armor is one type lighter then normal. Arcane Spell Failure decreased by 10%. Maximum dexterity bonus increased by 2. Armor check penalty reduced by 3.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008005000</span>8,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar_Challenge_Pack\" title=\"Eveningstar Challenge Pack\">Eveningstar Challenge Pack</a></b>, Turn in various ingredients\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement +15</a>:</b> Passive: +15 <a href=\"/page/Implement_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Implement bonus\">Implement bonus</a> to Universal <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +60</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +60</a>:</b> Passive: +60 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus  I</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus  I</a>:</b> +1 Equipment bonus to the DC of all spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a>:</b> Reduces the threat generated by ranged attacks and spells by 15%.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Dragon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Dragon.png/420px-Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Dragon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"301\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Dragon.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar_Challenge_Pack\" title=\"Eveningstar Challenge Pack\">Eveningstar Challenge Pack</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Dragon\" title=\"Item:Adamantine Cloak of the Dragon\">Adamantine Cloak of the Dragon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This cloak has threads of magically-conductive enchanted iron wire woven into it.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>Upgrade to <a href=\"/page/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Dragon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Adamantine Cloak of the Dragon\">Adamantine Cloak of the Dragon</a> by turning in 1600 Golden Lions, 800 Platinum Tricrowns, 1600 Enchanted Moss, 1600 Fey Toadstools, <a href=\"/page/Mithral_Cloak_of_the_Dragon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mithral Cloak of the Dragon\">Mithral Cloak of the Dragon</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817054824\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3438/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22503/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6153/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion ex